  m_Name: GemMerchant_Outro
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  merchantTextLines:
  - "Ah, you\u2019ve taken a spark from the flame. Good, It will guide you. If you
    <slide a=.2>let it.<slide a=.2>"
  - 'The path to The Verdant Graveyard is open. '
  - "There, you\u2019ll find the Armorer. He once kept the light alive for many,
    but those days are long gone"
  - "Perhaps he\u2019ll aid you, if you can remind him of what he\u2019s lost."
  - Go, and bring back what this place <bounce a=.2 f=1.2>needs</bounce> to grow.
